{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 505, "line_no": 2, "text": "如乌龟的半边山隔水相望，景色秀丽。", "bbox_px": {"x": 141, "y": 241, "w": 655, "h": 49}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "如乌龟的半边山隔水相望，景色秀丽。", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 141, "y": 241, "w": 655, "h": 49}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 505, "line_no": 3, "text": "该村分上下两寨，上寨系古屯堡区，民居全在屯墻之内，多为三合院民居，木构建筑，", "bbox_px": {"x": 221, "y": 302, "w": 1459, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "该村分上下两寨，上寨系古屯堡区，民居全在屯墻之内，多为三合院民居，木构建筑，", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 221, "y": 302, "w": 1459, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 505, "line_no": 4, "text": "石板装壁、石板盖屋面、石板铺天井。正房为面阔三间或五间，有吞口，堂屋置大门和腰", "bbox_px": {"x": 141, "y": 366, "w": 1540, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "石板装壁、石板盖屋面、石板铺天井。正房为面阔三间或五间，有吞口，堂屋置大门和腰", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 141, "y": 366, "w": 1540, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 505, "line_no": 5, "text": "门。大门上方有门簪，有向日葵图案或“福禄”字样。堂屋设神龛。窗户木雕图案精美。", "bbox_px": {"x": 141, "y": 430, "w": 1544, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "门。大门上方有门簪，有向日葵图案或“福禄”字样。堂屋设神龛。窗户木雕图案精美。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 141, "y": 430, "w": 1544, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 505, "line_no": 6, "text": "三合庭院民居设置朝门，与大门均不在一条轴线上。", "bbox_px": {"x": 141, "y": 495, "w": 901, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "三合庭院民居设置朝门，与大门均不在一条轴线上。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 141, "y": 495, "w": 901, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 505, "line_no": 7, "text": "下寨原建于河畔，1958年因修建花溪水库搬至屯墻之下“椅子形”地带。民居三", "bbox_px": {"x": 221, "y": 553, "w": 1464, "h": 68}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "下寨原建于河畔，1958年因修建花溪水库搬至屯墻之下“椅子形”地带。民居三", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 221, "y": 553, "w": 1464, "h": 68}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 505, "line_no": 8, "text": "排梯级结构，无院落，无隔墙，木构建筑。村内主干道由屯门可通下寨码头，各小巷道通", "bbox_px": {"x": 141, "y": 624, "w": 1540, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "排梯级结构，无院落，无隔墙，木构建筑。村内主干道由屯门可通下寨码头，各小巷道通", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 141, "y": 624, "w": 1540, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 505, "line_no": 9, "text": "至住户，形成丰富的建筑空间。", "bbox_px": {"x": 141, "y": 692, "w": 535, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "至住户，形成丰富的建筑空间。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 141, "y": 692, "w": 535, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 505, "line_no": 10, "text": "武庙是该村遗留下来的古公共建筑。始建于明万历年间（1573~1620年），清光绪二", "bbox_px": {"x": 221, "y": 752, "w": 1459, "h": 57}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "武庙是该村遗留下来的古公共建筑。始建于明万历年间（1573~1620年），清光绪二", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 221, "y": 752, "w": 1459, "h": 57}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 505, "line_no": 11, "text": "十四年（1908年）重建，面阔五间，通高约15米，占地250平方米。两厢、过厅已毁。正殿", "bbox_px": {"x": 145, "y": 821, "w": 1540, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "十四年（1908年）重建，面阔五间，通高约15米，占地250平方米。两厢、过厅已毁。正殿", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 145, "y": 821, "w": 1540, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 505, "line_no": 12, "text": "修葺于1995年。", "bbox_px": {"x": 141, "y": 888, "w": 290, "h": 50}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "修葺于1995年。", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 141, "y": 888, "w": 290, "h": 50}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 505, "line_no": 13, "text": "镇山村屯墻，据传始建于明万历年间（1537~1620年），清咸同年间补修。屯墻依山", "bbox_px": {"x": 221, "y": 949, "w": 1463, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "镇山村屯墻，据传始建于明万历年间（1537~1620年），清咸同年间补修。屯墻依山", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 221, "y": 949, "w": 1463, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 505, "line_no": 14, "text": "势而建，东段和南段均以悬崖屏而砌墙，全长700余米。南、北有石拱两座。", "bbox_px": {"x": 141, "y": 1014, "w": 1351, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "势而建，东段和南段均以悬崖屏而砌墙，全长700余米。南、北有石拱两座。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 141, "y": 1014, "w": 1351, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 505, "line_no": 15, "text": "历史人物墓：镇山南面的李村右侧山头有该村李姓先祖李仁宇墓，封土高约1.5米，", "bbox_px": {"x": 221, "y": 1078, "w": 1463, "h": 49}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "历史人物墓：镇山南面的李村右侧山头有该村李姓先祖李仁宇墓，封土高约1.5米，", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 221, "y": 1078, "w": 1463, "h": 49}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 505, "line_no": 16, "text": "墓碑阴刻“李仁宇将军墓”六字。相传，李仁宇系江西吉安府卢陵县人。因有战功，被明", "bbox_px": {"x": 141, "y": 1139, "w": 1540, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "墓碑阴刻“李仁宇将军墓”六字。相传，李仁宇系江西吉安府卢陵县人。因有战功，被明", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 141, "y": 1139, "w": 1540, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 505, "line_no": 17, "text": "廷授四品。另有一通石碑碑文记载了入赘镇山的历史。在镇山东面山头上有李仁宇两", "bbox_px": {"x": 141, "y": 1207, "w": 1544, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "廷授四品。另有一通石碑碑文记载了入赘镇山的历史。在镇山东面山头上有李仁宇两", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 141, "y": 1207, "w": 1544, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 505, "line_no": 18, "text": "个儿子的墓，据说这两个儿子曾被明廷封为德武将军和振武将军。", "bbox_px": {"x": 141, "y": 1271, "w": 1150, "h": 57}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "个儿子的墓，据说这两个儿子曾被明廷封为德武将军和振武将军。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 141, "y": 1271, "w": 1150, "h": 57}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 505, "line_no": 19, "text": "镇山村是集真山真水、民族建筑、历史遗存于一体的民族村寨。1995年经省人民政", "bbox_px": {"x": 221, "y": 1340, "w": 1463, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "镇山村是集真山真水、民族建筑、历史遗存于一体的民族村寨。1995年经省人民政", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 221, "y": 1340, "w": 1463, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 505, "line_no": 20, "text": "府批准为省级文物保护单位和民族文化村。2000年9月5日根据中国和挪威奥斯陆协", "bbox_px": {"x": 141, "y": 1404, "w": 1544, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "府批准为省级文物保护单位和民族文化村。2000年9月5日根据中国和挪威奥斯陆协", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 141, "y": 1404, "w": 1544, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 505, "line_no": 21, "text": "议，镇山建成为布依族文化生态博物馆。", "bbox_px": {"x": 145, "y": 1464, "w": 700, "h": 57}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "议，镇山建成为布依族文化生态博物馆。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 145, "y": 1464, "w": 700, "h": 57}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 505, "line_no": 22, "text": "镇宁石头寨 系布依族聚居的自然村寨，距镇宁布依族苗族自治县城约13公里，离", "bbox_px": {"x": 221, "y": 1533, "w": 1463, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "镇宁石头寨 系布依族聚居的自然村寨，距镇宁布依族苗族自治县城约13公里，离", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 221, "y": 1533, "w": 1463, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 505, "line_no": 23, "text": "举世闻名的黄果树瀑布仅2.5公里。隶属安庄乡。", "bbox_px": {"x": 141, "y": 1597, "w": 884, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "举世闻名的黄果树瀑布仅2.5公里。隶属安庄乡。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 141, "y": 1597, "w": 884, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 505, "line_no": 24, "text": "该寨坐南朝北，依山傍水，靠河临田，民居依山势建在岩石嶙峋的石山上。白水河从", "bbox_px": {"x": 225, "y": 1662, "w": 1463, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "该寨坐南朝北，依山傍水，靠河临田，民居依山势建在岩石嶙峋的石山上。白水河从", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 225, "y": 1662, "w": 1463, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 505, "line_no": 25, "text": "寨边绕过，形成三四个小洲，河水于洲间几经曲折，缓缓流淌。两岸垂柳飘拂，河水清澈", "bbox_px": {"x": 141, "y": 1726, "w": 1548, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "寨边绕过，形成三四个小洲，河水于洲间几经曲折，缓缓流淌。两岸垂柳飘拂，河水清澈", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 141, "y": 1726, "w": 1548, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 505, "line_no": 26, "text": "可见，风景十分秀丽。", "bbox_px": {"x": 145, "y": 1790, "w": 378, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "可见，风景十分秀丽。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 145, "y": 1790, "w": 378, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 505, "line_no": 27, "text": "全寨民居全系石木结构。房屋平面布局为三合院、房屋层高一般为两层，少数三层。", "bbox_px": {"x": 225, "y": 1851, "w": 1471, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "全寨民居全系石木结构。房屋平面布局为三合院、房屋层高一般为两层，少数三层。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 225, "y": 1851, "w": 1471, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 505, "line_no": 28, "text": "面阔二间、三间或五间不等。通进深约6米。四周砌石墙，防御性能好。全寨石巷交错，", "bbox_px": {"x": 145, "y": 1919, "w": 1544, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "面阔二间、三间或五间不等。通进深约6米。四周砌石墙，防御性能好。全寨石巷交错，", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 145, "y": 1919, "w": 1544, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 505, "line_no": 29, "text": "民居依山势而建，形成立体的建筑空间。民居第一层为起居活动中心，堂屋隔为前后两", "bbox_px": {"x": 145, "y": 1983, "w": 1544, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "民居依山势而建，形成立体的建筑空间。民居第一层为起居活动中心，堂屋隔为前后两", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 145, "y": 1983, "w": 1544, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 505, "line_no": 30, "text": "间，前间置神龛，供奉祖先，后间作灶房或住老人。第二层堆放粮食、杂物。左侧设吊脚", "bbox_px": {"x": 145, "y": 2048, "w": 1544, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "间，前间置神龛，供奉祖先，后间作灶房或住老人。第二层堆放粮食、杂物。左侧设吊脚", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 145, "y": 2048, "w": 1544, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 505, "line_no": 31, "text": "楼，下层关牲口，上层卧室，右侧为中青年起居室。", "bbox_px": {"x": 145, "y": 2116, "w": 905, "h": 49}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "楼，下层关牲口，上层卧室，右侧为中青年起居室。", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 145, "y": 2116, "w": 905, "h": 49}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
